{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09694","headline":"田使君美人舞如莲花北鋋歌 · 岑参","name":"田使君美人舞如莲花北鋋歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人舞如莲花旋，世人有眼应未见。\n高堂满地红氍毹，试舞一曲天下无。\n此曲胡人传入汉，诸客见之惊且叹。\n慢脸娇娥纤复穠，轻罗金缕花葱茏。\n回裾转袖若飞雪，左鋋右鋋生旋风。\n琵琶横笛和未匝，花门山头黄云合。\n忽作出塞入塞声，白草胡沙寒飒飒。\n翻身入破如有神，前见後见回回新。\n始知诸曲不可比，采莲落梅徒聒耳。\n世人学舞祗是舞，恣态岂能得如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}